      "source_text": "IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\nPROGRAM-ID. ELIGIBLE.\nDATA DIVISION.\nLINKAGE SECTION.\nCOPY LAYOUT.\nPROCEDURE DIVISION USING CUSTOMER-RECORD REFERRAL-RECORD.\n  IF AGE >= 18\n    MOVE \"Y\" TO DECISION\n  ELSE\n    MOVE \"N\" TO DECISION\n  END-IF.\n  IF ACTIVE = \"N\"\n    MOVE \"N\" TO DECISION\n  ELSE\n    CONTINUE\n  END-IF.\n  IF CUSTOMER-ID <> REF-CUSTOMER-ID\n    MOVE \"N\" TO DECISION\n  ELSE\n    CONTINUE\n  END-IF.\n  IF AMOUNT > 50000\n    MOVE \"R\" TO DECISION\n  ELSE\n    CONTINUE\n  END-IF.\n  GOBACK.\n"
    },
